<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico completes secondary participation.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico completes secondary participation.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico had assigned all three direct Cetes sales and both repos whereby it had sought to drain 1.705 billion pesos from the secondary market on Friday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>	AMOUNT     TERM	 AVERAGE</p>
<p>	150 million    356 days    22.93 pct</p>
<p>	150 million    181 days    21.75 pct</p>
<p>	150 million     90 days    20.80 pct</p>
<p>The repurchase agreements were placed as follows:</p>
<p>    1.000 bln	6 days    18.30 pct</p>
<p>	255 million	3 days    17.60 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
